<p>Lay a trap that explodes into a radius 2 cloud of freezing vapour when triggered.  Foes take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">104, 123, 137, 149, 160</acronym> cold damage and are pinned for 3 turns.</p><p>The freezing vapour persists for 5 turns, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">35, 41, 46, 50, 53</acronym> cold damage each turn to foes with a 25% chance to freeze.</p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>